sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as defradb.rs worker: create doc d as identity i
    participant T as regolith transaction
    participant O as another worker: create or upsert of d as identity j

    W->>T: transact begins
    W->>T: write the document: blocks, value, indexes, append(journal)
    W->>T: scan_validated(owner prefix of d): empty
    W->>T: put owner tuple: i owns d
    O->>T: in its own transaction: scan_validated(owner prefix of d): empty, put owner j
    W->>T: commit
    T-->>W: committed: d exists and is owned by i in the same commit, no public window
    O->>T: commit
    Note over T: a write landed in the owner prefix it scanned
    T-->>O: Conflict: mine ScannedRange, theirs Put
    O->>T: transact re-runs: owner prefix holds i
    Note over O: business logic: AlreadyRegistered, or a no-op when the owner is the same
    Note over W,O: a read-only query decides ACP at its own snapshot, the same snapshot as its rows
